VERDICT: fix
- The n1 conductor stops at y=258 but the LED anode (triangle top) sits at y=272, leaving a visible 14 px gap with current dots floating over dead space — extend the n1 wire and its dot path to 272.
- FLOWS contains a duplicate path for the pot's lower leg ([[POTX,470],[POTX,BOT]] appears both alone and as the first half of the next entry), doubling the dot density on that segment — remove the lone entry.
- The "burnt out" label is centred on the vertical n2 wire at (470,330), so the wire strikes through the text — move it to the side of the wire.

