<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>LED strung across a ±12 V bipolar supply</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#001A2B; --panel:#052B42; --panel2:#07334E; --line:#0E3A52;
    --wire:#C1C1FF; --accent:#DAFF33; --text:#FFFFFF; --muted:#8FB3C7;
    --red:#FF6B6B; --green:#43D9A3;
  }
